'''''Hook's Gift''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[Slices of Life Before the Furnace]].

==Steps==
# Ask about the details of the auction
# Tell Hook about the auction
# Return to the clinic, find Natasha, and get the toy bear
# Talk to the auctioneer to learn more details
# Find buyers and try to sell the toy at a high price
# (Optional) Find buyers and try to sell the toy at a high price
# (Optional) Find a potential buyer and help the lost child
# (Optional) Find a potential buyer and find the robot that took the contract
# (Optional) Find a potential buyer and talk to Gertie of the Goethe Grand Hotel
# (Optional) Find a potential buyer and return the contract to whoever lost it
# (Optional) Find a potential buyer and help the lost child
# (Optional) Find a potential buyer and talk to the old lady
# (Optional) Find a potential buyer and return the contract to whoever lost it
# Talk to the auctioneer and wait for the auction to begin

