===Ask about the details of the auction{{subst:void|<!--201090101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Boulder Town|update|You're informed that an auction will be held by the "Wildfire" in the underworld.<br />For more details, you need to consult the auction staff in Boulder Town. Go there if you're interested.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Used Item Auction Pamphlet|20|x=1}})

;(Talk to Auction Staff)
:'''Auction Staff:''' Love at first sight, sold at first strike! The Wildfire used item auction is opening soon! If you're interested, head down to the vagrant camp and get involved!
:'''Auction Staff:''' Outsider! I remember you. Perhaps you're hoping to find some treasures at the auction, too?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What kind of treasures can I find there?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No, not interested...
::'''Auction Staff:''' Don't just dash off! Let me tell you about it. I'm sure I can stoke your interest...
:'''Auction Staff:''' We're not sticklers at this auction &mdash; you'll find everything from exotic Belobog rarities to tattered roadside socks!
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why is Wildfire hosting an auction?
::'''Auction Staff:''' Oh after Wildfire got involved in the maintenance of the vagrant camp, they saw there was a big resource distribution problem. People would rather keep a stockpile of useless objects than exchange them for useful resources.
::'''Auction Staff:''' So we intend to hold a public auction. It will allow folks to make the best use of the stuff they have by exchanging it for stuff they need.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Who's going to the auction?
::'''Auction Staff:''' It's mostly vagrants from the camp, but Boulder Town residents are welcome to join as well, of course!
::'''Auction Staff:''' The more attendees we have, the more items there will be for trade, and the better we can meet the auction's goal!
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} How will the auction be held?
::'''Auction Staff:''' Buyers and sellers must all register their personal information. To ensure the quality of items, the sellers must also register details for each item.
::'''Auction Staff:''' Then there's the standard auction procedure. The auctioneer presents the items, and the bidders place their bids on the spot... Pretty straightforward, don't you think?
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What kind of treasures can I find at the auction?
::'''Auction Staff:''' Oh plenty! Gloves used by Chief Oleg, the domestic robot that Miss Fidora built...
::'''Auction Staff:''' There are lots of prospectors hunting for ancient relics in the vagrant camp, so there should be a lot of unique items at this auction. For example, I heard that one of the goods up for auction is a barely used Geomarrow Probe...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Geomarrow Probe?
::'''Auction Staff:''' Ah, never heard of a treasure like that before, huh? More excited about the auction now?
::'''Auction Staff:''' Oh, here &mdash; take this pamphlet. It has more information on all the rarities up for auction. Remember to stop by the vagrant camp! Be there or be square!
{{Dialogue End}}

===Tell Hook about the auction{{subst:void|<!--201090102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Boulder Town|update|You didn't expect to find a probe for the vein detector at this auction. This is a great gift, so you decide to tell Hook about it.<br />Now you can sell the toy bear "Junjun" and buy a perfect gift. Great!}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''(Trailblazer):''' I should tell Hook about the Geomarrow Probe... She might want to help Fersman get his treasure back.

;(Talk to Auction Staff)
:'''Auction Staff:''' Take a pamphlet, have a look, and don't lose it! Remember to stop by the vagrant camp for the auction. Be there or be square!

;(Talk to Hook)
:'''Hook:''' Ah, honorary member! I was just about to go see you!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's up, Pitch-Dark Hook the Great?
::'''Hook:''' Daddy's already planned his birthday party, but I haven't been able to sell Junjun... or buy a gift for him.
::'''Hook:''' What should I do? Honorary member &mdash; you think of something!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We should go get your dad's probe back.
::'''Hook:''' Ah! I was just about to ask you about the probe!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I have to tell you something first.
::'''Hook:''' Huh? What's so urgent? Spit it out!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I know where Fersman's probe is...
::'''Hook:''' Ah! How did you know what I was thinking? Hook was about to ask you about the probe!
:'''Hook:''' Honorary member, you found some clues?
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.ConsumeMissionItem",
	"SubMissionID": 201090102,
	"Desc": {
		"Hash": 3072912665091848274
	}
}</pre>
:'''Hook:''' The auction... So... that's where the probe is!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do you know what "auction" means?
::'''Hook:''' Hmph! Do you think Hook's stupid or something?
::'''Hook:''' At the auction, I can sell Junjun AND buy a birthday gift for daddy... Yeah!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The bad news is you'll have to compete with other bidders...
::'''Hook:''' That's nothing &mdash; you're here too! I've got the honorary member here to help me with the bidding!
:'''Hook:''' Junjun is still with the old witch. Let's go get him and then register for the auction!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Return to the clinic, find Natasha, and get the toy bear{{subst:void|<!--201090104-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Natasha's Clinic|update|To get "Junjun," you have to return to the clinic. Maybe Natasha will teach Hook another lesson.<br />But an auction is much safer than the Fragmentum, so Natasha might agree to let you go. Wait, perhaps you shouldn't reveal the truth to her...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}


;(Talk to Natasha)
:'''Hook:''' Stupid, witchy old... Natasha! Hehe, h&mdash;have you finished fixing Junjun?
:'''Natasha:''' Oh, your teddy bear? Hehe... He's nearly done. Here, take a look at him.
:'''Hook:''' Wow... He looks brand-new! Natasha, you're incredible.
:'''Natasha:''' Glad to be of service. Now then... did you really bring (Trailblazer) over here with you just to pick up Junjun? Come on now, what are you guys up to this time?
:'''Hook:''' We're going to the auct...
:'''Hook:''' Ah... n&mdash;no! That's not what we're going to do!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We're going to the auction...
::'''Hook:''' Hey! You bigmouth!
::'''Natasha:''' ...The auction, the one at the vagrant camp?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We're going to look for Julian and play hide-and seek-with him.
::'''Hook:''' Uh... yeah, that's right!
::'''Natasha:''' The auction... right Hook? The one at the vagrant camp?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We're not up to anything!
::'''Natasha:''' ...You've been spending too much time with Hook.
::'''Natasha:''' The auction... right Hook? The one at the vagrant camp?
:'''Natasha:''' So you made me go through all this effort to repair Junjun just so you could sell him...?
:'''Hook:''' I... uh... Psst, honorary member! Think of something!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Commencing plan "think of something."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I think we should give up...
:'''Natasha:''' Hehe, you two make an adorable duo.
:'''Natasha:''' I was only joking, Hook. Junjun is yours, and it's entirely up to you what you do with him. But you must make one promise to me...
:'''Hook:''' Wh&mdash;What is it?
:'''Natasha:''' Don't go charging into the Fragmentum again. Mr. Fersman heard about what you did and came to me to find out what happened.
:'''Natasha:''' Your dad worries about you &mdash; stop giving him reasons to.
:'''Hook:''' Daddy... Aw... Okay, I swear I'll never make Natasha or daddy worry again.
:'''Natasha:''' (Trailblazer), I'm going to have to trouble you to keep an eye on this kid again. You seem to be doing a good job, so I'll leave it at that.
:'''Natasha:''' Off you go then, and good luck.
:'''Hook:''' Thanks, Natasha! Honorary member, let's head to the auction!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Talk to the auctioneer to learn more details{{subst:void|<!--201090105-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|To sell "Junjun" at a good price, you need to figure out the rules of this auction. Asking the auctioneer is a wise choice.<br />After all, you need to register this toy bear, and preparation is necessary if you want a decent result.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Auctioneer)
:'''Auctioneer:''' Welcome! Are you here to take part in the auction?
:'''Hook:''' Yep! Hook wants to auction this teddy bear!
:'''Auctioneer:''' Teddy bear? How about I take a look at it first, little missy...
:'''Auctioneer:''' Hm... With all due respect, I don't think this item will generate much interest at the auction... I don't see any value in it.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Actually, this bear is worth quite a lot of money.
:'''Auctioneer:''' Hm, let me take another look... The craftsmanship is excellent, and the fabric is soft... but I'm afraid that won't command a high price on its own.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Take a closer look at the eyes...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Call yourself an auctioneer?
:'''Auctioneer:''' The eyes... wait a minute, that's natural erebus! Haha, what are precious gems doing on such an ugly teddy?
:'''Hook:''' Hey, who are you calling ugly? Take that back!
:'''Auctioneer:''' Well, well, well, who'd have thought it... Allow me to make a suggestion &mdash; you should only auction off the gems.
:'''Hook:''' What are you talking about? You can't just take Junjun's eyes off!
:'''Auctioneer:''' ...Alright, alright, don't get upset, little missy! I'll respect the wish of the owner and keep Junjun here intact.
:'''Auctioneer:''' Please sign this commodity contract here...
:'''Hook:''' Let me do it!
:'''Auctioneer:''' And if you and your friend would like to bid, please fill out this buyer registration form as well.
:'''Hook:''' Of course we'd like to bid! I'll sign again! (Trailblazer), ask about the probe!
:'''Auctioneer:''' Probe? Are you talking about the Geomarrow Probe? As far as I know, there are a lot of people interested in acquiring that device. The estimated sale price is no less than 600 shield.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's a lot of money!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's chump change!
::'''Hook:''' Stop bluffing!
:'''Auctioneer:''' Because it's a rare and useful treasure, the Geomarrow Probe will be up for bidding in the final round of the auction.
:'''Auctioneer:''' But don't worry, the gems on your teddy bear are also very valuable. You'll have the chance to bid on the probe if someone's willing to pay a high price for him.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm great at bidding a price up!
::'''Auctioneer:''' Oh? Then we'll be counting on you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He doesn't seem like he'll fetch too high a price.
::'''Auctioneer:''' Don't be so pessimistic!
:'''Auctioneer:''' I'll tell you a secret... {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|the more bidders there are, the more you can get for your bear here.}} This place is teeming with potential buyers. It only takes a gentle nudge to get them to join in.
:'''Hook:''' Hook doesn't get it. What are we supposed to do?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Persuade them with true love.
::'''Hook:''' Is "true love" really that useful? Hee-hee!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Deceive them with charismatic rhetoric.
::'''Hook:''' Hmm, I won't be much help then. Hook never deceives anyone!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Threaten them with hardball tactics.
::'''Hook:''' Yay! Diggertron's all set and ready to go!
:'''Hook:''' Let's ask around. Junjun's super cute &mdash; I'm sure there'll be loads of people interested in buying him.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Find buyers and try to sell the toy at a high price{{subst:void|<!--201090106-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|The more buyers who participate in the auction, the higher the bidding price of "Junjun." You don't know the plans of the buyers present, but the more, the merrier.<br />Everybody here will know that the cute toy bear "Junjun" will be auctioned today!}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Weird Man)
:'''Weird Man:''' Don't try making conversation with me! I don't trust anyone here!
:'''Weird Man:''' I'm warning you, there's only one winner at an auction &mdash; everyone here is one of my competitors!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you... hit your head?
::'''Hook:''' What a weird man...
::'''Weird Man:''' Hmph, I'll take that as a compliment! You think I can't hear you, you little brat?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Well, at least it's a friendly crowd.
::'''Weird Man:''' Haha, you think you can fool me? The friendlier they are on the outside, the more devious they are on the inside!
::'''Hook:''' Seems like this guy's got a real bad temper...
::'''Weird Man:''' Temper? What temper? I'm perfectly calm, thank you!
:'''Weird Man:''' You're sellers, right? I just caught sight of a teddy bear on the bid list. Is that yours?
:'''Weird Man:''' Hmph, you two with your poker faces... You've got a trick up your sleeves with that bear?
:'''Hook:''' ...This guy thinks that the whole world is against him... What should we do, honorary member?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The bear is garbage. Don't bid on it.
::'''Weird Man:''' ...Trying to dupe me into not bidding on it, huh? Fine, then I will bid for it! I won't let this opportunity slip!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Just ignore him...
::'''Weird Man:''' Don't want me to profit from your item, huh? Well in that case, I'm definitely gonna solve the mystery of your teddy bear, haha!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let him buy Junjun.
::'''Hook:''' But I don't wanna sell Junjun to such a weirdo...
::'''Weird Man:''' ...Don't want me to profit from your item, huh? Well in that case, I'll just have to place a bid and solve the mystery of your teddy bear, hahaha!
:'''Hook:''' What a weirdo... Anyway, at least we've tricked him into bidding for it!

;(Talk to Gemologist)
:'''Gemologist:''' Well, look at that. That's no ordinary teddy bear...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You sure about that?
::'''Gemologist:''' Oh! Uh... sorry, I was in a bit of a trance. I didn't know someone was about to strike up a conversation.
::'''Gemologist:''' Huh, you don't look like you'll be bidding on much, so I'll tell you... That teddy bear's eyes are genuine erebus!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Because its eyes are erebus?
::'''Gemologist:''' ...Wait, how did you know that!? Unless you're... a fellow gemologist?
::'''Gemologist:''' Ahem, yes... I didn't think anyone else had noticed. *sigh* I guess getting my hands on those gems won't be so simple after all...
:'''Gemologist:''' But it's so absurd... I don't understand why precious gems would be sewn onto a teddy bear. Is this some new kind of scam?
:'''Hook:''' ...So you don't think Junjun deserves those gems?
:'''Gemologist:''' Hehe, Junjun? Who's that?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No one! This kid's always spouting nonsense...
::'''Gemologist:''' It's okay, I didn't take it to heart.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We are, in fact, the bear's sellers.
::'''Gemologist:''' Oh, haha, wh&mdash;why didn't you bring that up earlier? Your item has piqued my curiosity.
:'''Gemologist:''' In any case, erebus of that purity is hard to come by in the Underworld. I have to get my hands on that bear, even if it means breaking the bank! Ha...
:'''Hook:''' Hmph, Junjun will break your bank for sure.

;(Talk to Reticent Vagrant)
:'''Reticent Vagrant:''' ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you interested in the teddy bear?
:'''Reticent Vagrant:''' ...Uh...uh...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He sure is cute and cuddly!
::'''Reticent Vagrant:''' I...
::'''Hook:''' His design is super cute and he's really really soft! You can't help but give him a biiiig hug!
::'''Hook:''' You'll have sweet dreams every night as long as Junjun's by your side! Intrigued...?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Keep staring at him and wait for him to speak.)
:::'''Reticent Vagrant:''' Hm... I... hm...
:::'''Reticent Vagrant:''' ...
:::'''Hook:''' According to the old witch, some people aren't good at talking in front of other people. Why not ask him to write his thoughts down?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Give him a pen and paper.)
::::'''Reticent Vagrant:''' Mm? *sigh*
::::'''Reticent Vagrant:''' ...Here.
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ..."Not interested"?
:::::'''Reticent Vagrant:''' Right...
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Apologies. We'll leave now.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No need, he doesn't look interested.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Not interested? Sorry for bothering you...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Not interested? Sorry for bothering you...
{{Dialogue End}}

