{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|As someone with a high sense of responsibility, you need to be sure that the old lady has found her grandson.<br />Perhaps she will buy "Junjun" out of joy... This sounds unrealistic, but who knows?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Waiting Elderly)
----
:<!--0.5-second delay-->
:'''Hook:''' Isn't this the kid we just saved?
:'''Timid Little Boy:''' Ah! It's that brave girl!
:'''Timid Little Boy:''' Grandma, grandma! They're the ones who saved me.
:'''Old Lady With Poor Eyesight:''' Oh my goodness! I can't even begin to express my gratitude!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We had to intervene.
::'''Old Lady With Poor Eyesight:''' Thank you both so much. He's my only grandson &mdash; and I don't know what I would've done.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Not even monetarily?
::'''Hook:''' Hey! What are you doing!? You're making Hook angry!
:'''Timid Little Boy:''' Can we buy the teddy bear at the auction, grandma?
:'''Old Lady With Poor Eyesight:''' Oh! I'm sure that teddy bear must've belonged to a nice person... Let's go and take a look.
:'''Old Lady With Poor Eyesight:''' If grandma wins the auction, don't tell your parents I bought it! Let's pretend it was a gift from this kind {{MC|ж=young lady|м=young man}}.
:'''Timid Little Boy:''' Grandma's the best!
----
:'''Hook:''' Aww, they're really sweet! Junjun will be super happy if they take him home...
:'''Hook:''' *sigh* Anyway, we should get going. Come on, honorary member!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

